{
  "$comment": [
    "What POST /objects returns for each photograph in this directory, and the",
    "Subject Box the kart producer composes from it. Recorded from the real",
    "model rather than drawn by hand — nobody can place a motorbike box on a",
    "kart to four decimal places — and then verified by rendering every box",
    "over its photograph and looking at it. So the regression claim is the",
    "coordinates and the human claim is `note` and `subjectNote`.",
    "Not to be confused with expected.json beside it, which is the Not-a-Face",
    "ground truth for the same photographs and is about faces, not objects.",
    "Read by packages/faces/scripts/objects-test.ts for the detections, by",
    "scripts/crop-solver-test.ts for the union rule, and by",
    "scripts/http-probe.ts to stand in for the service.",
    "Provenance and licence of the photographs: LICENCE.md beside this file."
  ],
